# AuroraOS Kconfig overlay: LM3S6965 with the network stack compiled out.
#
# Why this preset exists
# ----------------------
# The default lm3s6965-qb configuration enables CONFIG_NETWORKING, so the
# `#ifdef CONFIG_NETWORKING` branches in apps/kernel.cpp and apps/shell.cpp
# are never compiled in CI.  A change that accidentally makes networking code
# unconditional (or that breaks the net-off path) would therefore only surface
# on the RAM-constrained boards, which build a different source set.
#
# Used by the `kconfig-matrix` job:
#   cmake -DAURORA_KCONFIG_OVERLAY=config/presets/lm3s6965-net-off.config ...
#
# CONFIG_NETWORKING is not set
